<!doctype html>
<html lang="he" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="הארון שלי">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f8f5">
<title>הארון שלי · AI</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f4f8f5;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --green: #138a4f;
    --green-2: #0f6e40;
    --green-soft: #e8f5ee;
    --line: #e1ede6;
    --text: #13251d;
    --muted: #6b7c74;
    --red: #e5484d;
    --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(19,138,79,.07);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
  html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; color: var(--text); background: var(--bg);
    font-family: -apple-system, "SF Pro Hebrew", "Heebo", system-ui, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  button, input { font: inherit; }
  svg { display: block; }
  [hidden] { display: none !important; }

  .app { min-height: 100dvh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    padding: calc(env(safe-area-inset-top) + 12px) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px)) calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 100px) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px)); }

  header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 4px 6px 16px; }
  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .brand .logo { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--green-2)); color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(19,138,79,.28); }
  header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--green-2); letter-spacing: -.3px; }
  .link { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px;
    border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; cursor: pointer; }

  .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 32px;
    padding: 20px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); animation: rise .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both; }
  .card h2 { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .card h2 .ico { color: var(--green); }
  .count { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; }
  .label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin: 18px 0 10px; color: var(--muted); }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 14px; }

  .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .chip { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--text);
    border-radius: 999px; height: 38px; padding: 0 16px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform .15s, background .2s, color .2s, box-shadow .2s; }
  .chip:active { transform: scale(.96); }
  .chip.on { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--green-2)); border-color: transparent;
    color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(19,138,79,.25); }

  .btn { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; width: 100%; height: 50px;
    margin-top: 18px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--green-2)); color: #fff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(19,138,79,.25); transition: transform .15s; }
  .btn:active { transform: scale(.98); }
  .btn:disabled { opacity: .6; }
  .btn.outline { background: #fff; color: var(--green); border: 1.5px solid var(--line); box-shadow: none; }

  .divider { height: 1px; background: var(--line); margin: 20px 0; }

  .pick { position: relative; display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 4px; }
  .pick label { position: relative; flex: 1; display: grid; place-items: center; gap: 6px; height: 104px; cursor: pointer;
    border: 1.5px dashed #a6d6ba; border-radius: 28px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--green);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f3fbf6, var(--green-soft)); text-align: center; }
  .pick input { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; opacity: 0; cursor: pointer; }
  .preview { position: relative; margin-top: 12px; height: 200px; border-radius: 28px; overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--green-soft); display: grid; place-items: center; }
  .preview img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; display: block; }
  .preview .busy { position: absolute; font-size: 14px; color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }
  .preview button { position: absolute; top: 10px; inset-inline-end: 10px; width: 32px; height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%; border: 0; background: rgba(255,255,255,.95); color: var(--red); cursor: pointer;
    display: grid; place-items: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }

  .toggle { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: #f8fcfa; border: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .toggle input { width: 20px; height: 20px; accent-color: var(--green); }
  .toggle small { display: block; font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }

  input.email { width: 100%; height: 50px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #f8fcfa; padding: 0 20px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); outline: none; }
  input.email:focus { border-color: var(--green); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(19,138,79,.12); }

  .outfit { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(96px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
  .slot { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 3/4; border-radius: 26px; overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fff, var(--green-soft)); border: 1.5px dashed #b5dcc6;
    display: grid; place-items: center; align-content: center; gap: 6px; color: #8fb9a1; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; }
  .slot img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; background: #fff; }
  .slot span { position: absolute; bottom: 8px; inset-inline: 8px; text-align: center; background: rgba(255,255,255,.92);
    border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 8px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); font-size: 11px; }
  .note { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin: 12px 2px 0; min-height: 18px; }

  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .item { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 3/4; border-radius: 28px; overflow: hidden;
    background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; padding-bottom: 12px;
    animation: rise .4s both; }
  .item img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; background: #fff; }
  .item .x { position: absolute; top: 10px; inset-inline-end: 10px; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.95); border: 0; color: var(--red); cursor: pointer;
    display: grid; place-items: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
  .item .tag { background: rgba(255,255,255,.92); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text);
    padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05); }
  .empty { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: 10px; text-align: center;
    color: var(--muted); padding: 32px 0; font-size: 14px; }
  .empty .ring { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green-soft);
    color: var(--green); display: grid; place-items: center; }

  .fab { position: fixed; bottom: calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 84px); inset-inline-end: 20px;
    width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; border: 0; cursor: pointer; color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--green-2)); box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(19,138,79,.35);
    display: grid; place-items: center; z-index: 5; }
  .fab:active { transform: scale(.94); }

  .tabbar { position: fixed; bottom: 0; inset-inline: 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-around;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.88); backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%);
    border-top: .5px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08); padding: 8px 10px calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 8px); }
  .tab { background: none; border: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 3px;
    color: #8a9a92; font-size: 11px; min-width: 64px; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: color .2s, background .2s; }
  .tab.on { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; background: var(--green-soft); }

  .screen { display: none; } .screen.on { display: block; }

  .toast { position: fixed; top: calc(env(safe-area-inset-top) + 12px); left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -160%);
    background: #13251d; color: #fff; font-size: 14px; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 999px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.2); transition: transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1); z-index: 10; max-width: calc(100% - 32px); text-align: center; }
  .toast.show { transform: translate(-50%, 0); }

  @keyframes rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; } }

  .app{max-width:1000px;margin:auto}.startup{padding:12px 20px;margin:0;background:#fff0d7;color:#573800;text-align:center;font-size:14px}
  button,input,select{font:inherit}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #298754;outline-offset:3px}
  .pick{margin-top:20px}.pick label:focus-within{outline:3px solid #298754}.pick input:disabled{cursor:wait}
  .save-status{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--green-2);padding:12px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--green-soft);margin-bottom:0}
  .preview .busy{inset-inline:12px;bottom:10px;padding:7px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);text-align:center}
  .error-note{font-size:13px;color:#8f3b16;line-height:1.5}.item{padding:0;aspect-ratio:3/4}.item img{object-fit:cover}
  .item-info{position:absolute;inset-inline:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);padding:10px;display:grid;gap:4px;min-height:82px}
  .item-info strong{font-size:13px}.item-info small{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.item-actions{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .item-actions button{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 8px;background:#fff;color:var(--green-2);font-size:11px;cursor:pointer}
  .ai-status{display:grid;gap:12px;background:var(--green-soft);border-radius:20px;padding:16px;line-height:1.5}.ai-status small{color:var(--muted)}progress{width:100%;accent-color:var(--green)}
  .demo-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}.demo-pair figure{margin:0}.demo-pair img{width:100%;border-radius:18px}.demo-pair figcaption{text-align:center;font-size:13px;margin-top:7px}
  .model-details{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted)}.model-details summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--green-2);font-weight:700}.model-details a{color:var(--green-2)}
  .tab{min-width:48px;flex:1;padding-inline:6px}.tabbar{z-index:8}.file-button{cursor:pointer}
  dialog{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:24px;max-width:430px;width:calc(100% - 24px);color:var(--text)}dialog::backdrop{background:#102b2077}dialog h2{margin-top:0}dialog label{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:14px}dialog input,dialog select{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px;background:#fff;min-width:0}
  @media(min-width:650px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.card{padding:28px}.app{padding-bottom:110px}.tabbar{max-width:600px;inset-inline:0;margin:auto;border-radius:24px 24px 0 0}.fab{inset-inline-end:max(22px,calc((100vw - 1000px)/2 + 22px))}}
  @media(min-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
  <defs>
    <symbol id="i-shirt" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 3 4 5l2 4 2-1v11h8V8l2 1 2-4-4-2a4 4 0 0 1-8 0z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-pants" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 3h10l1 18h-4l-2-10-2 10H6z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-shoe" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 15c2 0 3-3 6-3 2 0 3 2 5 2h7v3H3z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-hanger" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 7a2 2 0 1 0-2-2M12 7v2M3 17l9-6 9 6z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-camera" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 8h3l2-3h6l2 3h3v11H4z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-image" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="9" cy="10" r="1.8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M4 18l5-5 4 4 3-3 4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-sparkle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l1.8 5.2L19 10l-5.2 1.8L12 17l-1.8-5.2L5 10l5.2-1.8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-sliders" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h2M10 17h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="8" cy="17" r="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-closet" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M12 3v18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="10" cy="12" r=".6" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="14" cy="12" r=".6" fill="currentColor"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-x" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-plus" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></symbol>
  </defs>
</svg>

<noscript><p class="startup">כדי שהארון יעבוד, פתחו את הקובץ בדפדפן עם JavaScript פעיל.</p></noscript><p id="startupNotice" class="startup" role="status">טוען את הארון… אם המסך אינו מגיב, פתחו את הקובץ באמצעות Chrome או Edge.</p><div class="app">
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo"><svg width="22" height="22"><use href="#i-hanger"/></svg></div>
      <h1>הארון שלי</h1>
    </div>
    <button class="link" id="openAI">מרכז AI</button>
  </header>

  <section class="screen on" id="look">
    <div class="card">
      <h2><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20"><use href="#i-sparkle"/></svg>הרכיבו לי לוק</h2>
      <div class="outfit" id="outfit">
        <div class="slot"><svg width="30" height="30"><use href="#i-shirt"/></svg></div>
        <div class="slot"><svg width="30" height="30"><use href="#i-pants"/></svg></div>
        <div class="slot"><svg width="30" height="30"><use href="#i-shoe"/></svg></div>
      </div>
      <div class="note" id="outfitNote"></div>
      <div class="label">אירוע</div>
      <div class="chips" data-group="event">
        <button class="chip on">בית ספר</button>
        <button class="chip">יום רגיל</button>
        <button class="chip">חתונה</button>
        <button class="chip">יציאה</button>
      </div>
      <div class="label">מזג אוויר</div>
      <div class="chips" data-group="weather">
        <button class="chip on">חם</button>
        <button class="chip">קר</button>
      </div>
      <button class="btn" id="make">צרו לוק</button>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <button class="btn outline" id="smart"><svg width="18" height="18"><use href="#i-sparkle"/></svg>סטייליסט AI — ניתוח התמונות והתאמה לאירוע</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="screen" id="add">
    <div class="card">
      <h2><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20"><use href="#i-camera"/></svg>הוספת בגד</h2>
      <div class="label">סוג</div>
      <div class="chips" data-group="type">
        <button class="chip on">חולצה</button>
        <button class="chip">נעליים</button>
        <button class="chip">מכנסיים / חצאית</button>
        <button class="chip">מעיל / סווטשירט</button>
      </div>
      <div class="label">מתאים ל־</div>
      <div class="chips" data-group="fit">
        <button class="chip">בית ספר</button>
        <button class="chip on">יום רגיל</button>
        <button class="chip">חתונה</button>
        <button class="chip">יציאה</button>
      </div>
      <div class="label">מזג אוויר</div>
      <div class="chips" data-group="wx">
        <button class="chip on">כל מזג אוויר</button>
        <button class="chip">חם</button>
        <button class="chip">קר</button>
      </div>
      <div class="pick">
        <label>
          <svg width="26" height="26"><use href="#i-camera"/></svg>צלם עכשיו
          <input type="file" accept="image/*" capture="environment" id="shoot" aria-label="צלם עכשיו" disabled>
        </label>
        <label>
          <svg width="26" height="26"><use href="#i-image"/></svg>מהגלריה
          <input type="file" accept="image/*" id="gallery" multiple aria-label="בחירת תמונות מהגלריה" disabled>
        </label>
      </div>
      <div class="preview" id="preview" hidden>
        <span class="busy" id="busy" hidden>מעבד את התמונה...</span>
        <img id="previewImg" alt="">
        <button id="clearPhoto" aria-label="סגירת התצוגה; הבגד נשאר שמור"><svg width="14" height="14"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></button>
      </div>
      <label class="toggle">
        <span>טשטוש רקע אוטומטי ב-AI<small>הבגד נשאר חד. הצילום נשמר לפני תחילת העיבוד.</small></span>
        <input type="checkbox" id="removeBg" checked>
      </label>

      <p id="saveStatus" class="save-status" role="status">בחרו את סוג הבגד ואז צלמו או בחרו תמונות. הן נשמרות אוטומטית.</p>
      <p class="error-note" id="photoError" role="status"></p>
      <div id="photoActions" hidden>
        <button class="btn outline" id="classifyPhoto">זיהוי סוג הבגד ב-AI</button>
        <p id="visionSuggestion" class="note"></p>
        <button class="btn outline" id="acceptVision" hidden>קבל את הצעת הזיהוי</button>
        <button class="btn outline" id="retryPhoto" hidden>נסה שוב טשטוש רקע</button>
      </div>
      <button class="btn" id="openCloset">לארון שלי</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="screen" id="closet">
    <div class="card">
      <h2><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20"><use href="#i-closet"/></svg>הארון שלי <span class="count">(<span id="count">0</span>)</span></h2>
      <div class="chips" data-group="filter" id="filter">
        <button class="chip on" data-f="הכל">הכל</button>
        <button class="chip" data-f="חולצה">חולצה</button>
        <button class="chip" data-f="מכנסיים / חצאית">מכנסיים / חצאית</button>
        <button class="chip" data-f="נעליים">נעליים</button>
        <button class="chip" data-f="מעיל / סווטשירט">מעיל / סווטשירט</button>
      </div>
      <p class="note">הבגדים נשמרים אוטומטית. אפשר לערוך סוג וסגנון בכל פריט.</p><button class="link" id="undoDelete" hidden>בטל את המחיקה האחרונה</button><div class="grid" id="grid"></div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="screen" id="ai">
    <div class="card">
      <h2><svg class="ico" width="22" height="22"><use href="#i-sparkle"/></svg>מרכז ה-AI שלי</h2>
      <p class="muted">טשטוש רקע, זיהוי סוג הבגד והצעות לסטייל לפי תמונות הארון.</p>
      <div class="ai-status"><strong id="aiStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite">מוכן לעיבוד התמונות</strong><progress id="aiProgress" max="100" hidden></progress><small id="queueNote"></small></div>
      <p class="note">בפעם הראשונה נדרש אינטרנט להורדת המודלים. ההורדה עשויה לקחת כמה דקות. התמונות מעובדות במכשיר.</p>
      <button class="btn" id="testAI">בדיקת AI על תמונת מכנסיים</button>
